      "content": "API for accessing music track audio analysis, features (tempo, key, mode, energy, danceability, valence, instrumentalness, acousticness, loudness), search, and recommendations. SoundStat is an independent audio-analysis alternative to the deprecated Spotify audio-features endpoints.",
